<title>USA: USDA signs $10 mln PL480 pact with El Salvador.</title>
<headline>USDA signs $10 mln PL480 pact with El Salvador.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said it signed a Title 1, Public Law 480 agreement with El Salvador for the sale of $6.0 million in soybean meal, $2.8 million in vegetable oil and $1.2 million in tallow.</p>
<p>The department said the action will provide $10 million for the purchase of about 20,000 tonnes of soybean meal, 5,400 tonnes of vegetable oil and 2,400 tonnes of tallow.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
